title: Password Spray Across Many Accounts
id: 29749c88-b693-438e-b4f3-154f6934c475
status: experimental
description: Detects a password-spray pattern where one source IP produces failed logons (4625) against many distinct accounts in a short window, testing a few passwords broadly to avoid lockouts.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1110/003/
logsource:
  product: windows
  service: security
detection:
  selection:
    EventID: 4625
  timeframe: 10m
  condition: selection | count(TargetUserName) by IpAddress > 20
  condition: selection
fields:
  - SubjectUserName
  - TargetUserName
  - IpAddress
falsepositives:
  - Misconfigured service causing many failures
level: high
tags:
  - attack.credential_access
  - attack.t1110.003
